WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Baghdad, the year 922.

2
00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.750
A Muslim mystic named
al-Hallaj is executed.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.520
He had said: I am the Real.

4
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.820
And the Real is a name of God.

5
00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.710
His opponents called such words blasphemy.

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.370
Many Sufis read them very differently.

7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.110
So what did he mean, and
what do Sufis say of God?

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.710
In this mission, you'll meet another Sufi
whose sayings sounded just as shocking.

9
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.380
Then you'll compare two kinds of
Sufism: the drunken and the sober.

10
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.180
Your mission: find out
what the mystic meant,

11
00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.240
and what Sufis say of God.
